        <!--
            Reset for this fork. Upstream's 48 entries were dropped rather than rebranded: every
            one pointed at an Open Island ZIP and carried an EdDSA signature made with upstream's
            private key. Renaming them would have left a feed that hands Dev Island users a
            different product on their next update check.

            This feed stays empty until the fork has its own Sparkle keypair (Sparkle's
            `generate_keys`): the public half goes to scripts/package-app.sh as
            DEV_ISLAND_EDDSA_PUBLIC_KEY, the private half becomes the SPARKLE_EDDSA_KEY repository
            secret. Items are added by the release workflow. See docs/releasing.md.
        -->
    </channel>
